  "query_preview": "../Tuesday through Friday/...A short wave moves to the\nSE AK area with a frontal band moving to the northeast gulf coast\non Tuesday and then the panhandle Tuesday night through \nWednesday. With an upper level high over the central pacific the \nflow pattern weather is looking more zonal from the just south of \nthe Aleutians to the northern panhandle for the later half of the \nweek. So expect the continued onshore flow to maintain the rain \nanticipated across the region. 24 hour rain totals in the 3/4 inch\nto 1.5 inch range, and models beginning to suggest a wave a bit \nfurther south with amounts focused over the southern third of the \npanhandle, for the Thursday to Friday timeframe.",
